<<
/Title (A seesaw easily illustrates the delicate balance of managing each building block and why each building block is set in a specific order. For example, the more our unconscious bias affects how we speak to or treat people, the less aware we are of how our behaviour impacts those around us. Our bias also shapes the other building blocks. The less self-aware we are, the harder it is to build bridges.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 305 0 R
/Next 229 0 R
